hk-transport (港交寶)
=====================

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers this repository's source code.

Bundled data
------------

`src/hk_transport/data/mtr_exits.json` is a snapshot derived from the Lands
Department "Location Search" API and "Coordinates Transformation" API,
published on data.gov.hk.

Fares, routes, station and facility tables, and the live MTR feeds are read
from data.gov.hk at run time. They are not redistributed in this repository.

Use of that data is subject to the data.gov.hk terms and conditions:
https://data.gov.hk/tc/terms-and-conditions
